[1.2] 派生维度：qkv_dim = num_heads*head_dim = 64*128 = 8192
      conv_dim = qkv_dim*3 = 24576（q/k/v 拼成一路做 depthwise conv）
      conv1d.weight (24576, 1, 4)  groups=24576
      checkpoint 中拆为 q/k/v_conv1d 各 [8192,1,4] → 合计 [24576,1,4] = (24576, 1, 4)  一致=True
==============================================================================
1.3 遗忘门（forget gate）取值范围
==============================================================================
      safe_gate_lower_bound = -5.0  (config.linear_attn_config.gate_lower_bound)
      → 走 safe 分支：g = lower_bound * sigmoid(exp(A_log) * (f_b(f_a(x)) + dt_bias))
      g.shape = (1, 16, 64, 128)  (B, S, num_heads, head_dim) → 逐头逐通道独立衰减
      g 范围 [-4.019433, -0.841495]，全部 < 0 = True
      递推里用的是 g.exp()，即衰减因子范围 [0.017963, 0.431065] ⊂ (0,1)
      A_log=0,dt_bias=0 时理论值 = lower_bound*sigmoid(0) = -5.0*0.5 = -2.5；实测均值 = -2.500885
      衰减因子理论 exp(-2.5) = 0.082085
==============================================================================
1.4 delta rule 递推公式核对（手算 vs 官方 recurrent kernel）
==============================================================================
      官方 kernel 输出 vs 手算最大绝对误差 = 0.000e+00
      终态最大绝对误差 = 0.000e+00
      注：q 在 kernel 内乘 scale = 1/sqrt(head_dim) = 0.500000；k 只做 l2norm 不乘 scale
